@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam wrapWidth 210
skinparam maxMessageSize 120
title D01 用例图 · 角色权限
left to right direction
actor 顾客 as C
actor 酒店工作人员 as S
actor 平台管理员 as A
rectangle 酒店预订系统 {
usecase "登录" as U1
usecase "顾客注册" as U11
usecase "查询房源与查看资料" as U2
usecase "本人预订与模拟付款" as U3
usecase "本人订单查询/取消/修改" as U4
usecase "本酒店接单与线下订房" as U5
usecase "入住/退房/清洁确认" as U6
usecase "本酒店资料与房量价格申请" as U7
usecase "本酒店应急处置\n候选权限 A11" as U8
usecase "审核变更与设置费率" as U9
usecase "跨酒店订单/统计/日志查询" as U10
}
C --> U1
C --> U11
C --> U2
C --> U3
C --> U4
S --> U1
S --> U5
S --> U6
S --> U7
S --> U8
A --> U1
A --> U9
A --> U10
note bottom of U4
顾客仅本人；员工仅本酒店。
管理员查询权限不等于所有写权限。
付款退款模拟；电话与备案在系统外。
end note

@enduml
